OL,3,GNEWSAWind farm planned close to Flow
OL,4,ACountry World Heritage Site
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for up to 12 wind turbines near
OL,7,Fthe Flow Country World Heritage Site in
OL,8,Fthe Highlands have been submitted to
OL,9,Fthe Scottish government.
OL,11,FLow Carbon said its Forsinain Forest
OL,12,FWind Farm, proposed for land 2 miles
OL,13,F(3km) north of Forsinard, would be
OL,14,F"fully outwith" the Unesco-designated
OL,15,Fsite.
OL,17,FIt said the project include proposals
OL,18,Fto restore 383 acres of non-native
OL,19,Fforest to peatbog.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
